// ===================== 4.5 =====================
out.push(pb());
out.push(h2('4.5  The opinion somebody else relies on'));
out.push(S('Stage 1 · Get ready'));
out.push(A('**a** Open. ⚠ **One sentence each, and the third party named** — **an insurer, a court, a panel, a donor, a council, an editor.** **Then the count that makes the cycle: how many of the ten have ever seen what the third party did with it.** **In most classes it is two or three.** **Write that figure up and leave it, because it is the reason this cycle costs more than any other in Book 1.**'));
out.push(A('**b** Limit inside the claim: **2** and **5**. ⚠ **Not 1, 3 or 4.** **3 is the one to read aloud** — _in my opinion the frame does not meet the specification, although I should add that access was limited_ — **and ask what a schedule would carry.** _The frame does not meet the specification._ **The _although_ clause is separable and everything separable is separated.** **4 is the same fault with a full stop instead of a comma, and it is the commonest form in professional prose.** ⚠ **2 and 5 cannot be quoted without their limits because the limit is the subject of the sentence**: _on the forty-one positions I was able to reach on 7 August_ **is not a qualification of the claim, it is what the claim is about.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 2 · Listen and read'));
out.push(A('**a** **B** — ⚠ **a limit in its own sentence can be separated by anybody quoting it**, and a third party quotes the claim and not the paragraph.'));
out.push(A('**b** **1** **His 2021 opinion was quoted in a schedule as _the slab is non-compliant_** — ⚠ **four words of a three-paragraph finding, and the limit was in the third paragraph.**   **2** **A limit in a separate sentence does not survive translation**, because a translator working to a word count drops the sentence that looks like a qualification.'));
out.push(NOTE('⚠ **Stage 4b is the hardest minute in Book 1 and it must not be softened.** **The partner is the third party and tries to produce a usable one-line version of the student\'s finding for a schedule.** **If they can, the limit is separable and the finding has to be written again.** **About half of first attempts survive** — **and the half that do not are usually the best-written ones, because a well-made sentence with a well-made qualification after it is exactly what quotes well.** **Say that out loud when it happens**, because the student who has just failed is usually the strongest writer in the room and will otherwise conclude the wrong thing. ⚠ **The three elements are the repair and they are mechanical: a count, a date, and the boundary of your own act.** _Of the fifty positions, forty-one were measured by me on 7 August and nine were not._'));
out.push(NOTE('**The second half of this cycle is about the class and not the examination, and it is where Unit 4 earns its place in the course.** ⚠ **Mr Zahreddine\'s paragraph about the request on site — _I was asked to leave the bolt sizes out of my note and I declined_ — is in the model because an opinion a third party relies on has to record what was asked of the writer.** **Students will read it as self-protection and it is not: it is the only way an insurer in eighteen months can tell whether anything was withheld.** **Ask the room who in their own professions has been asked to leave something out, and wait.** **Somebody always has** — ⚠ **and the useful question is not whether they refused but whether they wrote the request down, and almost nobody has.**'));
out.push(S('Language box · Practise'));
out.push(A('**1** _On the forty-one positions I was able to reach on 7 August, the bolts measure M12 against a specified M16._   **2** _Of the forty-one admissions in the book between January 2023 and March 2026, thirty-one had a second sample._   **3** _Of the thirty-eight sets of results retrieved, seven showed a serological diagnosis._   **4** _The site copy of the requisition, which I saw on 7 August, is amended by hand; I have not seen the file copy._   **5** ⚠ _On the three Saturdays I was present in June, nineteen people were turned away._ **Three Saturdays of about thirteen is a limit that makes the finding nearly useless** — **and it stays inside the claim, because a reader who is given nineteen without the three Saturdays will spend money on it.**'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Item 5 is the one that matters and it is counter-intuitive, so give it the time.** **The instinct, when a limit is severe, is to move it out of the sentence so the finding can breathe.** **That is precisely when it must stay in** — **a weak finding quoted without its limit is the one that causes the damage, and the writer is the only person who will ever be in a position to prevent it.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 3 · Practise (sample – Card A)'));
out.push(SAMPLE([
  '**1** _On the forty-one positions I was able to reach on 7 August, the bolts measure M12._ → ⚠ **inside.** _A count, a date and the boundary of his own act, and no part of it can be quoted alone._',
  '**2** _The frame does not meet the specification. Nine positions were not inspected._ → **outside.** _The first sentence is the quotation and the second is a footnote._',
  '**3** _In my opinion the slab is non-compliant, although access was limited._ → **outside**, _and the_ although _makes it worse by sounding like candour._',
  '**4** _Of the thirty-eight sets of results retrieved, seven showed a serological diagnosis._ → ⚠ **inside**, _and_ retrieved _is doing the work: it says what was looked at and implies what was not._',
  '**5** _The referral book was in the vehicle. This was on at least four Saturdays._ → **outside**, _and_ at least _invites the reader to supply a larger number._',
]));
out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('The short versions, and which four cannot be cut. ⚠ **Collect the short versions on the board as the third party would write them.** **The four that cannot be cut are the four with a count and a date inside the subject of the sentence**, and the class should be made to say what makes them resistant rather than being told. **It is grammatical and not moral**: ⚠ **a limit that is a prepositional phrase in front of the verb cannot be removed without rewriting the sentence, and a limit in its own sentence can be removed by not copying it.** **That is the whole technique and it takes one minute to teach and a career to apply.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
