out.push(A('**288 words, the limit inside the claim in the first sentence with all three elements, an exhaustive list of what was not examined, the inference refused and the reason for refusing it, what would change the report, and the request recorded.** ⚠ **The sentence that earns the band is _the sheet and the dispensing being two records of one act and either of them capable of being the wrong one._** **It refuses the inference the whole report invites, and it is the sentence that will make a reader believe the eleven.**'));
