out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('Each pair\'s two questions and the answers. ⚠ **Pair B is the one where the document does not exist** — **no calibration record was ever kept — and the fourth move has to change: _what would you accept instead of a calibration record?_** **asked of the reader, who is the only person who can decide what will do.** **The class should be asked how they would know which case they are in**, and the test is in the writer\'s own limit: ⚠ **_I have not seen X_ means X exists and somebody holds it; _X cannot be established_ means it may not exist at all.** **Two formulations, two different conversations, and most writers use them interchangeably.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
